WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.160
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.430 --> 01:34.920
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.259 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 18]

4
01:38.570 --> 01:39.840
Here today,

5
01:39.250 --> 01:40.550
[Mao Zedong, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee,]

6
01:40.550 --> 01:41.200
[Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic,]

7
01:40.890 --> 01:42.400
I want to summarize

8
01:41.200 --> 01:41.860
[Chairman of the Council of People's Commissars]

9
01:43.200 --> 01:44.530
your mistakes.

10
01:44.840 --> 01:47.430
[Li De, Military Adviser of the Communist International]

11
01:45.120 --> 01:47.650
I think your mistakes fall into 3 stages.

12
01:47.600 --> 01:48.320
[Zhu De, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee,]

13
01:48.170 --> 01:49.130
The first stage,

14
01:48.320 --> 01:48.680
[Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,]

15
01:48.680 --> 01:49.039
[Commander-in-Chief of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

16
01:49.530 --> 01:51.570
adventurism in attack.

17
01:51.360 --> 01:52.680
[Zhou Enlai, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

18
01:52.170 --> 01:53.120
The second stage,

19
01:52.680 --> 01:53.340
[Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,]

20
01:53.340 --> 01:54.000
[General Political Commissar of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

21
01:53.410 --> 01:55.470
conservatism in defense.

22
01:54.340 --> 01:56.930
[Deng Xiaoping, Secretary-General of the CPC Central Committee]

23
01:55.930 --> 01:57.009
The third stage,

24
01:57.320 --> 01:59.370
flightism in retreat.

25
02:06.530 --> 02:07.090
[Kai Feng (He Kequan), Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee,]

26
02:07.090 --> 02:07.660
[CPC Central Committee Representative to the 9th Red Army Corps]

27
02:09.180 --> 02:10.710
[Peng Dehuai, Commander of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

28
02:12.290 --> 02:13.760
By defining them this way,

29
02:14.010 --> 02:16.040
aren't you saying that the Central Committee's military line

30
02:16.040 --> 02:17.200
is completely wrong?

31
02:16.920 --> 02:18.100
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Head of the CPC Central Committee]

32
02:22.730 --> 02:23.640
Chairman Mao,

33
02:23.850 --> 02:25.570
your summary just now was very accurate.

34
02:25.570 --> 02:26.800
I completely agree.

35
02:26.690 --> 02:29.540
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

36
02:27.010 --> 02:28.290
Please tell us more

37
02:28.410 --> 02:29.850
about your military strategy.

38
02:29.850 --> 02:31.170
Come on, tell us.

39
02:31.200 --> 02:32.079
Come on, tell us.

40
02:32.079 --> 02:32.890
Tell us.

41
02:32.920 --> 02:33.690
Tell everyone.

42
02:33.690 --> 02:35.410
Yes, Chairman, tell us.

43
02:35.440 --> 02:35.960
Okay.

44
02:36.990 --> 02:38.390
Then I will talk about it.

45
02:40.040 --> 02:41.079
Comrade Kai Feng,

46
02:41.760 --> 02:43.250
you haven't been in the Soviet Area for long.

47
02:43.250 --> 02:44.510
You should listen too.

48
02:44.520 --> 02:46.780
You can give your opinion after I finish.

49
02:47.750 --> 02:50.420
To explain the military strategic guidelines clearly,

50
02:50.380 --> 02:51.430
[Chen Yun, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee,]

51
02:50.650 --> 02:52.720
we must first recognize

52
02:51.430 --> 02:52.490
[Political Commissar of the Military Commission Column]

53
02:52.890 --> 02:55.840
the characteristics of China's revolutionary war.

54
02:56.420 --> 02:58.290
I think there are 4 characteristics.

55
02:58.290 --> 02:59.600
The first characteristic was

56
02:59.600 --> 03:02.250
that China was plagued by widespread

57
03:02.700 --> 03:04.360
military fragmentation and chaos.

58
03:04.360 --> 03:05.480
This also provides

59
03:05.650 --> 03:08.850
the possibility for our revolutionary armed forces to develop.

60
03:08.850 --> 03:11.110
China is a large country with a vast area.

61
03:11.200 --> 03:13.010
When it is dark in the east, it is light in the west.

62
03:13.010 --> 03:14.570
When things go dark in the south, there is still the north.

63
03:14.570 --> 03:16.170
This also gives us enough

64
03:16.370 --> 03:18.030
room for strategic maneuver.

65
03:19.520 --> 03:21.250
The second characteristic...

66
03:23.800 --> 03:25.530
is that the enemy is too strong.

67
03:25.970 --> 03:27.040
When I say the enemy is strong,

68
03:27.040 --> 03:28.480
it has a different meaning

69
03:28.480 --> 03:30.079
from what Comrade Bo Gu said.

70
03:30.640 --> 03:32.300
When I say the enemy is strong,

71
03:32.860 --> 03:35.210
I mean the number of KMT troops

72
03:35.800 --> 03:37.170
exceeds that of any army

73
03:37.190 --> 03:38.660
in any era of Chinese history.

74
03:38.600 --> 03:40.300
[Wang Jiaxiang, Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee,]

75
03:39.480 --> 03:41.079
The amount of weapons, equipment,

76
03:40.300 --> 03:41.150
[Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,]

77
03:41.150 --> 03:42.010
[Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

78
03:41.290 --> 03:42.760
and military supplies they have

79
03:42.760 --> 03:44.290
is also unprecedented.

80
03:44.920 --> 03:45.970
This leads to

81
03:46.690 --> 03:49.800
the third characteristic of China's revolutionary war:

82
03:49.800 --> 03:51.660
the Red Army is too weak and small.

83
03:51.860 --> 03:53.390
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

84
03:52.640 --> 03:55.290
How can we compare with the KMT troops?

85
03:53.390 --> 03:54.930
[Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

86
03:55.160 --> 03:56.380
[Liu Bocheng, Chief of the General Staff of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

87
03:55.850 --> 03:56.920
Compared to them,

88
03:56.380 --> 03:57.610
[and concurrently Commander of the Military Commission Column]

89
03:57.130 --> 04:00.530
we are like a beggar showing off his wealth to the Dragon King.

90
04:00.760 --> 04:01.820
How can we compare?

91
04:02.800 --> 04:03.680
Is this sentence easy to translate?

92
04:03.680 --> 04:04.310
Yes.

93
04:07.570 --> 04:10.280
But we don't need to be pessimistic because of this,

94
04:10.280 --> 04:11.880
because our Chinese revolutionary war

95
04:11.880 --> 04:13.540
has a fourth characteristic.

96
04:13.920 --> 04:16.740
That is, the armed forces of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army

97
04:16.740 --> 04:18.320
are led by the Communist Party.

98
04:18.320 --> 04:19.450
The Red Army has

99
04:19.709 --> 04:21.910
emerged from the agrarian revolution.

100
04:22.160 --> 04:24.050
We persist in the agrarian revolution

101
04:24.050 --> 04:25.770
to gain the support of the peasants,

102
04:25.770 --> 04:29.230
who make up the overwhelming majority of China's population.

103
04:29.320 --> 04:31.720
This is the strong vitality of our Red Army.

104
04:32.810 --> 04:34.530
The first and fourth characteristics

105
04:34.530 --> 04:37.130
determine the possibility of the Red Army's development

106
04:37.130 --> 04:39.930
and its ultimate ability to defeat a strong enemy.

107
04:41.080 --> 04:42.840
The second and third characteristics

108
04:42.840 --> 04:45.770
determine that the Red Army cannot develop too fast,

109
04:46.080 --> 04:48.540
nor can it defeat the enemy quickly.

110
04:49.530 --> 04:50.240
Comrades.

111
04:50.450 --> 04:51.710
This is what I consider

112
04:51.770 --> 04:54.050
the characteristics of China's revolutionary war.

113
04:54.050 --> 04:55.650
All strategies and tactics

114
04:56.760 --> 04:58.810
should be based on these characteristics.

115
04:58.810 --> 04:59.840
Let's put it this way.

116
04:59.840 --> 05:02.010
If anyone does not formulate strategies and tactics

117
05:02.010 --> 05:03.940
based on these 4 characteristics,

118
05:04.080 --> 05:06.680
they cannot guide China's revolutionary war,

119
05:06.840 --> 05:10.160
and they cannot lead the Chinese Red Army to victory.

120
05:11.630 --> 05:14.160
This is the law of China's revolutionary war.

121
05:14.740 --> 05:16.200
What is Mao talking about?

122
05:17.520 --> 05:19.040
He is talking about laws.

123
05:18.710 --> 05:20.610
[Wu Xiuquan, Translator]

124
05:19.930 --> 05:20.850
Laws.

125
05:22.280 --> 05:23.720
Then, if we

126
05:24.080 --> 05:25.490
master this law,

127
05:25.720 --> 05:27.250
can we win every battle?

128
05:27.840 --> 05:28.810
Of course not.

129
05:29.250 --> 05:31.250
The situation on the battlefield changes rapidly.

130
05:31.250 --> 05:32.460
We should, based on

131
05:32.490 --> 05:34.640
the specific situation of each battle,

132
05:34.640 --> 05:35.840
flexibly

133
05:36.159 --> 05:39.020
formulate corresponding strategies and tactics.

134
05:39.159 --> 05:41.930
Sometimes we defend in order to attack,

135
05:42.130 --> 05:43.730
retreat in order to advance,

136
05:44.159 --> 05:46.610
flank the side in order to attack the front,

137
05:46.890 --> 05:47.890
and take a detour

138
05:48.320 --> 05:50.130
in order to go straight.

139
05:50.320 --> 05:51.450
What is this called?

140
05:51.610 --> 05:53.940
This is called flexibility and mobility.

141
05:54.010 --> 05:55.270
Commander-in-Chief.

142
05:55.610 --> 05:57.520
Isn't our policy for guerrilla warfare

143
05:57.520 --> 05:58.890
proposed in this way?

144
05:59.250 --> 06:00.250
Yes.

145
06:01.400 --> 06:02.600
The key to this policy

146
06:02.720 --> 06:05.810
lies in flexibility and mobility,

147
06:05.960 --> 06:07.940
and in destroying the enemy through maneuver.

148
06:07.940 --> 06:10.380
We relied on it to win so many battles,

149
06:10.310 --> 06:12.330
[Liu Shaoqi, Alternate Member of the CPC Politburo and CPC Representative to the 5th Red Army Corps]

150
06:10.760 --> 06:13.560
and it helped us establish the Central Soviet Area.

151
06:13.560 --> 06:14.760
During the first Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

152
06:14.760 --> 06:16.890
we retreated when the enemy advanced,

153
06:17.010 --> 06:17.840
lured the enemy deep into our territory,

154
06:17.840 --> 06:18.860
and concentrated superior forces.

155
06:18.860 --> 06:19.730
Then in Longgang,

156
06:19.730 --> 06:21.170
we annihilated

157
06:21.400 --> 06:22.840
the main force of the Kuomintang's 18th Division in one day.

158
06:22.840 --> 06:23.610
Mao.

159
06:23.840 --> 06:25.700
You even wrote a poem at that time.

160
06:26.610 --> 06:27.690
"All cried as one,

161
06:27.860 --> 06:29.860
'We've captured Zhang Huizan!'"

162
06:31.810 --> 06:32.570
Chairman.

163
06:32.640 --> 06:36.320
When the soldiers dragged him out of the pit,

164
06:36.409 --> 06:38.090
he said he was a cook.

165
06:38.320 --> 06:40.200
But when the captives saw him,

166
06:38.850 --> 06:40.860
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

167
06:40.240 --> 06:42.080
they called him Division Commander.

168
06:42.080 --> 06:43.400
Then he was exposed.

169
06:44.380 --> 06:45.180
Exposed.

170
06:45.210 --> 06:46.020
This tactic

171
06:46.400 --> 06:48.130
was used by Instructor Lin in "Water Margin"

172
06:48.130 --> 06:49.930
at the mansion of Lord Chai

173
06:50.220 --> 06:52.140
when he fought Instructor Hong.

174
06:52.330 --> 06:53.860
When two fighters face off,

175
06:54.159 --> 06:56.890
the smart fighter will take a step back first

176
06:57.960 --> 06:59.200
to observe and analyze.

177
06:59.200 --> 07:01.080
Watching that fool "fighter" Zhang Huizan

178
07:01.080 --> 07:03.050
charge toward you,

179
07:03.570 --> 07:04.840
you kept your eyes on him, waited for the right moment,

180
07:04.840 --> 07:05.900
and landed a punch.

181
07:06.020 --> 07:07.400
One punch decides the winner.

182
07:07.400 --> 07:08.640
Defeat the enemy with one move.

183
07:08.640 --> 07:10.370
What is he talking about again?

184
07:10.380 --> 07:12.340
He is talking about Lin Chong.

185
07:13.610 --> 07:14.740
Talking about what?

186
07:15.570 --> 07:16.320
History.

187
07:16.470 --> 07:18.050
In the 2nd Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

188
07:18.050 --> 07:20.050
the KMT troops changed its tactics.

189
07:20.080 --> 07:21.520
They didn't dare to drive straight in anymore.

190
07:21.520 --> 07:24.130
They changed to a steady advance, consolidating at every step.

191
07:24.130 --> 07:26.400
Then what were our strategy and tactics?

192
07:27.280 --> 07:28.690
Mobile warfare to annihilate the enemy.

193
07:28.690 --> 07:32.250
Looking for opportunities in movement, concentrating our forces,

194
07:32.250 --> 07:33.640
and striking the weak enemy first.

195
07:33.640 --> 07:35.080
We marched 350 kilometers,

196
07:35.080 --> 07:36.250
fought 5 battles,

197
07:36.570 --> 07:37.760
and captured over 20,000 rifles.

198
07:37.760 --> 07:38.520
350 kilometers.

199
07:38.520 --> 07:39.200
5 battles.

200
07:43.720 --> 07:45.050
After this battle,

201
07:45.130 --> 07:47.450
Mao wrote another poem.

202
07:47.520 --> 07:50.320
"350 kilometers in 15 days;

203
07:50.490 --> 07:53.150
The Gan River vast, the Fujian mountains green;

204
07:53.280 --> 07:55.720
Sweeping through a thousand foes like a mat rolled up."

205
07:55.720 --> 07:57.159
Good, good.

206
07:58.050 --> 07:59.010
During...

207
07:59.250 --> 08:01.810
During the 3rd Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

208
08:01.810 --> 08:04.400
Chiang Kai-shek personally led an army of 300,000,

209
08:04.400 --> 08:06.960
including 100,000 elite Central Army troops.

210
08:06.960 --> 08:08.690
It was another straight drive in,

211
08:08.690 --> 08:11.200
attempting to annihilate us at the Gan River.

212
08:11.200 --> 08:12.370
How did we fight?

213
08:12.640 --> 08:13.840
We avoided their main force.

214
08:13.840 --> 08:15.520
First, we took a roundabout route of 500 kilometers,

215
08:15.520 --> 08:17.610
and returned to Xingguo to concentrate.

216
08:17.610 --> 08:18.860
Then, from west to east,

217
08:18.860 --> 08:20.390
we penetrated the enemy's

218
08:20.510 --> 08:22.040
rear communication lines,

219
08:22.050 --> 08:23.450
making them hit nothing but air.

220
08:23.450 --> 08:24.850
Then we led the KMT troops

221
08:24.860 --> 08:26.320
in the Central Soviet Area

222
08:26.450 --> 08:28.890
on an armed parade for over 2 months.

223
08:29.960 --> 08:31.160
Armed parade.

224
08:31.260 --> 08:32.740
Armed parade.

225
08:34.150 --> 08:36.400
Then, taking advantage of their exhausted troops,

226
08:36.400 --> 08:38.330
we flexibly changed our tactics

227
08:38.530 --> 08:40.039
and struck their weak points.

228
08:40.039 --> 08:41.030
We successively defeated Shangguan Yunxiang,

229
08:41.030 --> 08:42.760
Hao Mengling, and Mao Bingwen,

230
08:42.850 --> 08:45.020
winning all 3 battles and annihilating over 30,000 enemies.

231
08:45.020 --> 08:45.750
Satisfying!

232
08:45.890 --> 08:47.330
This battle was the most satisfying.

233
08:47.330 --> 08:49.010
Principal Chiang personally served as commander-in-chief,

234
08:49.010 --> 08:50.440
bringing along a few senior schoolmates from Whampoa,

235
08:50.440 --> 08:52.490
and we beat the crap out of them.

236
08:53.850 --> 08:54.560
Mao.

237
08:54.800 --> 08:57.280
Why did you forget to write a poem after this battle?

238
08:57.280 --> 08:58.440
I did.

239
08:59.090 --> 09:00.820
I wrote a "Pride of Fishermen".

240
09:00.940 --> 09:03.300
It's not finished, just a draft.

241
09:04.160 --> 09:05.480
I'll read it to everyone today.

242
09:05.480 --> 09:06.890
Good, good.

243
09:06.910 --> 09:07.860
Good, good.

244
09:10.870 --> 09:13.470
"The valiant Red Army fights hand to hand,

245
09:14.190 --> 09:16.990
wherever the red flags wave, the white flags fall.

246
09:17.370 --> 09:20.570
The earth shakes, the heavens roar, winds and rain surge.

247
09:20.640 --> 09:21.900
Thunderbolts strike!

248
09:22.680 --> 09:25.370
Today, the enemy chieftain shall be taken alive."

249
09:25.370 --> 09:26.330
Good, good.

250
09:29.990 --> 09:30.950
Chairman,

251
09:31.170 --> 09:32.250
it's written so well.

252
09:32.250 --> 09:34.240
[Li Fuchun, Acting Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

253
09:32.470 --> 09:34.120
I want to write it down.

254
09:36.700 --> 09:38.110
What is he still talking about?

255
09:38.110 --> 09:40.500
He's talking about poetry.

256
09:42.250 --> 09:43.210
Comrades.

257
09:43.760 --> 09:45.370
In the 4th Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

258
09:45.370 --> 09:47.890
although Comrade Zedong didn't participate,

259
09:47.890 --> 09:50.640
when the Commander-in-Chief and I formulated the strategic policy,

260
09:50.640 --> 09:52.640
we still followed Comrade Zedong's

261
09:52.640 --> 09:55.440
principles of mobile warfare to achieve victory.

262
09:56.250 --> 09:57.130
Chairman Mao,

263
09:57.280 --> 09:58.970
tell us more.

264
09:58.970 --> 09:59.610
Tell us more.

265
09:59.610 --> 09:59.890
Sure.

266
09:59.890 --> 10:00.750
Yes, Chairman.

267
10:00.850 --> 10:02.710
Who will pour me some water first?

268
10:03.610 --> 10:04.670
Comrade Xiaoping.

269
10:04.890 --> 10:05.440
Here.

270
10:06.440 --> 10:08.130
"As the wine runs low, all the more I relish the bitter tea."

271
10:08.130 --> 10:10.400
Today we have no wine and no tea,

272
10:10.640 --> 10:11.440
only water.

273
10:11.610 --> 10:14.250
But the guests haven't left, and the mood is high.

274
10:14.250 --> 10:15.550
Let's just talk to our hearts' content.

275
10:15.550 --> 10:16.310
-Good. -Yes.

276
10:18.440 --> 10:19.840
Careful, it's hot. Here.

277
10:22.920 --> 10:24.210
This water is too hot.

278
10:24.230 --> 10:26.290
If I drink it, I won't be able to speak.

279
10:31.160 --> 10:32.360
At this moment,

280
10:32.560 --> 10:34.330
the people sitting in the meeting room

281
10:34.330 --> 10:37.010
may not realize how huge a role this meeting

282
10:37.010 --> 10:40.330
will play in the future,

283
10:40.640 --> 10:42.560
and how profoundly it will change

284
10:41.670 --> 10:43.990
[Dayong, Hunan; Headquarters of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

285
10:42.850 --> 10:45.330
the fate of the Chinese revolution.

286
10:46.400 --> 10:47.370
At this moment,

287
10:47.150 --> 10:48.070
[Ren Bishi, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee,]

288
10:48.040 --> 10:50.330
the Red Army troops active in other areas

289
10:48.070 --> 10:49.000
[Political Commissar of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

290
10:49.580 --> 10:50.510
[Wang Zhen, Political Commissar of 6th Red Army Corps]

291
10:50.490 --> 10:53.910
do not know that this meeting is being held in Zunyi.

292
10:50.510 --> 10:51.450
[Xiao Ke, Commander of the 6th Red Army Corps]

293
10:55.130 --> 10:58.250
Some of them have just established new base areas,

294
10:58.510 --> 11:00.750
facing the heavy encirclement and suppression of the enemy,

295
10:58.810 --> 11:00.940
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

296
11:01.040 --> 11:03.330
and urgently need to formulate new combat plans.

297
11:01.090 --> 11:04.160
[Zhen'an, Shaanxi; Temporary Encampment of the 25th Red Army]

298
11:03.970 --> 11:07.440
Some are launching campaigns

299
11:04.390 --> 11:07.220
[Cheng Zihua, Commander of the 25th Red Army]

300
11:07.440 --> 11:08.770
in accordance with their own strategic plans,

301
11:08.770 --> 11:10.820
[Xu Haidong, Deputy Commander of the 25th Red Army]

302
11:09.040 --> 11:10.760
not knowing the Central Red Army's

303
11:10.760 --> 11:12.920
next direction of action.

304
11:13.440 --> 11:16.440
Some have just encountered a surprise attack by the enemy,

305
11:16.440 --> 11:18.770
and are making their way to new positions.

306
11:18.900 --> 11:21.520
[Yudu, Jiangxi; Headquarters of the Central Bureau]

307
11:19.160 --> 11:21.160
Some are in the enemy's encirclement,

308
11:21.160 --> 11:22.400
fighting desperately to break out.

309
11:21.720 --> 11:22.550
[Xiang Ying, Secretary of the Secretariat of the CPC Central Committee,]

310
11:22.550 --> 11:23.380
[Secretary of the CPC Central District in the Soviet Area]

311
11:22.890 --> 11:26.920
Some are surrounded by the enemy,

312
11:26.920 --> 11:30.010
waiting eagerly for the latest instructions from the Central Committee.

313
11:27.430 --> 11:29.170
[Qu Qiubai, Minister of the Propaganda Department of the CPC Central Bureau in the Soviet Area]

314
11:29.270 --> 11:34.260
[Dexing, Jiangxi; Temporary Encampment of the 10th Red Army Corps]

315
11:30.210 --> 11:32.360
Some are trying hard to change

316
11:32.360 --> 11:34.220
the situation of fighting alone,

317
11:34.330 --> 11:35.730
preparing to unite

318
11:34.380 --> 11:35.860
[Fang Zhimin, Chairman of the Military and Political Committee of the 10th Red Army Corps]

319
11:35.730 --> 11:38.610
to deal with the encirclement and suppression of the KMT troops.

320
11:38.610 --> 11:41.680
Everyone waited in silence

321
11:41.920 --> 11:44.980
for the thunderclap that would shatter the stillness.

322
11:46.990 --> 11:50.200
[Chiyuan County, Shaanxi (now within Zichang City)]

323
11:50.200 --> 11:52.860
[Liu Zhidan, Chairman of the Revolutionary Military Commission of the Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region]

324
11:52.860 --> 11:57.950
[Moscow]

325
11:54.160 --> 11:56.970
The day before yesterday, we received a letter

326
11:56.970 --> 11:59.850
written to us by Hailan from the Shanghai Central Bureau of the CPC.

327
11:59.850 --> 12:02.520
He said that since last October,

328
12:02.520 --> 12:07.560
after Sheng Zhongliang, Secretary of the Shanghai Central Bureau of the CPC,

329
12:07.560 --> 12:12.520
and several other comrades were arrested,

330
12:12.520 --> 12:16.760
three radio stations in Shanghai were exposed.

331
12:17.280 --> 12:20.160
They have been out of contact

332
12:20.160 --> 12:25.920
with both us and the CPC Central Committee

333
12:26.280 --> 12:28.970
for 3 months.

334
12:28.970 --> 12:31.890
They don't know how the strategic transfer

335
12:31.890 --> 12:34.370
of the Central Red Army is going.

336
12:34.370 --> 12:37.270
Due to the transfer, the Red Army

337
12:37.290 --> 12:40.880
lost most of the Central Soviet Area.

338
12:41.040 --> 12:43.560
This is undoubtedly a heavy loss.

339
12:44.130 --> 12:45.520
But the loss of land

340
12:45.520 --> 12:47.920
is only a brief interlude.

341
12:48.010 --> 12:49.560
Not only can it be made up for

342
12:49.560 --> 12:53.010
by capturing areas in other provinces,

343
12:53.250 --> 12:56.130
but through a series of battle results.

344
12:56.280 --> 13:00.320
The gains have already outweighed the losses.

345
12:59.290 --> 13:02.910
[Pavel Mif, Deputy Head of the Comintern's Eastern Department]

346
13:00.370 --> 13:04.250
But judging from the situation we currently grasp,

347
13:04.280 --> 13:07.520
the situation does not seem optimistic.

348
13:07.520 --> 13:12.610
I hope that, as Baker said in his letter,

349
13:08.820 --> 13:11.290
[Kang Sheng, Deputy Head of the CPC Delegation to the Comintern]

350
13:12.680 --> 13:17.330
those are all enemy rumors.

351
13:18.040 --> 13:22.720
I believe Bo Gu, Li De, and Luofu

352
13:23.090 --> 13:24.760
have a way.

353
13:49.180 --> 13:51.610
So our meeting must be thorough.

354
13:53.440 --> 13:54.970
Comrades, air raid siren.

355
13:55.010 --> 13:55.760
Evacuate quickly.

356
13:55.760 --> 13:56.800
Enemy planes came so early.

357
13:56.800 --> 13:57.760
Everyone, go downstairs quickly.

358
13:57.760 --> 13:58.680
-Okay. -Okay.

359
14:02.010 --> 14:03.130
Everyone, no need to transfer.

360
14:03.130 --> 14:04.330
Just now, one of our soldiers

361
14:04.330 --> 14:05.700
in charge of air defense warning

362
14:05.700 --> 14:06.570
[Deng Fa, Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee;]

363
14:05.850 --> 14:06.760
mistook a big bird

364
14:06.570 --> 14:07.440
[Director of the State Political Security Bureau]

365
14:06.760 --> 14:07.820
for an enemy plane.

366
14:09.010 --> 14:10.130
A false alarm.

367
14:10.370 --> 14:11.500
Everyone, sit down.

368
14:12.160 --> 14:13.800
Mao, please continue.

369
14:14.400 --> 14:16.400
I was talking until my mouth was dry,

370
14:16.640 --> 14:18.500
and this big bird interrupted me.

371
14:18.700 --> 14:19.630
Comrades,

372
14:20.090 --> 14:21.690
we mistook a bird for a plane.

373
14:21.810 --> 14:23.210
It was just a false alarm.

374
14:23.610 --> 14:25.370
If we mistook a plane for a bird,

375
14:25.610 --> 14:26.970
made a wrong judgment,

376
14:27.250 --> 14:28.710
and made a wrong decision,

377
14:28.800 --> 14:30.130
disaster would strike.

378
14:36.090 --> 14:37.330
I request to speak.

379
14:38.010 --> 14:39.510
Comrade Jiaxiang, you have a fever.

380
14:39.510 --> 14:40.570
Just sit and speak.

381
14:40.680 --> 14:44.040
No, I must stand straight for what I'm about to say.

382
14:45.210 --> 14:46.280
I have 3 points.

383
14:46.640 --> 14:47.560
First,

384
14:47.970 --> 14:50.280
I completely agree with Comrade Luofu

385
14:50.300 --> 14:52.300
and Comrade Mao Zedong's speeches.

386
14:52.440 --> 14:53.160
Second,

387
14:53.330 --> 14:54.460
practice has proven

388
14:54.530 --> 14:56.800
that we should immediately abolish the Troika,

389
14:56.800 --> 14:58.640
and suspend Comrade Li De

390
14:58.800 --> 15:01.680
and Comrade Bo Gu's military command.

391
15:01.890 --> 15:02.600
Third,

392
15:02.780 --> 15:04.840
we should invite Comrade Mao Zedong,

393
15:05.150 --> 15:07.420
a comrade with practical experience,

394
15:07.800 --> 15:09.400
to command the Red Army.

395
15:09.770 --> 15:11.210
I have finished speaking.

396
15:11.210 --> 15:12.940
-I second that. -I second that.

397
15:14.470 --> 15:15.590
Comrades,

398
15:16.070 --> 15:18.070
let's end today's meeting here.

399
15:18.380 --> 15:19.350
It's been all night,

400
15:19.350 --> 15:20.550
and everyone is tired.

401
15:20.550 --> 15:21.790
Let's take a rest,

402
15:21.970 --> 15:23.180
handle the work at hand,

403
15:23.180 --> 15:25.640
and discuss anything else in the afternoon.

404
15:26.640 --> 15:27.560
Leaders,

405
15:27.760 --> 15:28.700
the headquarters

406
15:28.700 --> 15:30.470
has prepared food for everyone long ago.

407
15:30.470 --> 15:31.550
But now,

408
15:31.680 --> 15:33.340
dinner has become breakfast.

409
15:44.040 --> 15:45.610
Great, just in time.

410
15:46.010 --> 15:48.490
Let's enjoy the hospitality of the general headquarters.

411
15:48.490 --> 15:49.250
Let's eat.

412
15:49.670 --> 15:51.200
Let's go downstairs to eat.

413
15:51.330 --> 15:52.330
Leaders, please.

414
15:53.780 --> 15:54.990
I'm really hungry.

415
16:01.180 --> 16:02.150
Comrade Bo Gu,

416
16:02.970 --> 16:04.490
let's go eat together.

417
16:06.030 --> 16:07.080
Comrade Enlai.

418
16:07.100 --> 16:08.300
I'm too tired and have no appetite.

419
16:08.300 --> 16:09.230
You go eat first.

420
16:09.760 --> 16:10.330
Okay.

421
16:16.680 --> 16:18.410
We're leaving, Comrade Enlai.

422
16:27.560 --> 16:29.160
Where are you going, Li De?

423
16:32.210 --> 16:33.130
Comrade Li De.

424
16:37.970 --> 16:39.880
You go eat first. We need to talk.

425
16:42.250 --> 16:44.090
Regarding their so-called opinions,

426
16:44.090 --> 16:47.280
I won't accept a single word.

427
16:48.130 --> 16:49.160
Comrade Li De,

428
16:49.540 --> 16:53.180
it's not a matter of whether you accept it or not now.

429
16:53.400 --> 16:54.520
Zhou betrayed us.

430
16:54.560 --> 16:55.490
And Luofu.

431
16:55.670 --> 16:57.270
I warned you long ago.

432
16:57.320 --> 16:59.690
Both of them have now sided with Mao.

433
17:02.090 --> 17:03.760
Zhou Enlai has never been

434
17:03.760 --> 17:05.400
our personal subordinate.

435
17:05.839 --> 17:09.410
He is a member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo,

436
17:09.630 --> 17:15.349
Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission.

437
17:15.369 --> 17:16.890
As for Luofu,

438
17:16.920 --> 17:20.000
he has long stood with Mao Zedong.

439
17:20.720 --> 17:21.960
Now it seems,

440
17:22.190 --> 17:25.230
regarding our mistakes in the military line,

441
17:25.260 --> 17:27.650
they have reached a consensus.

442
17:27.950 --> 17:28.470
Bo Gu,

443
17:29.260 --> 17:30.520
what's wrong with you?

444
17:31.270 --> 17:32.810
Are you going to side with them too?

445
17:32.810 --> 17:35.330
This is not a matter of taking sides at all,

446
17:35.890 --> 17:37.920
nor is it just a matter of military line.

447
17:37.920 --> 17:39.510
Regarding the issue of the wrong military line they raised,

448
17:39.510 --> 17:40.900
especially Mao Zedong's speech,

449
17:40.900 --> 17:43.580
I-I have nothing to say.

450
17:43.920 --> 17:45.960
I have other concerns.

451
17:46.090 --> 17:47.890
Are you worried that they will take advantage of

452
17:47.890 --> 17:49.090
our loss of contact with the Comintern

453
17:49.090 --> 17:52.950
to change the Party's line established at the Fourth Plenary Session

454
17:53.470 --> 17:54.240
of the Sixth Central Committee?

455
17:54.240 --> 17:56.690
If there are too many changes in this meeting,

456
17:56.690 --> 17:58.400
after I get in touch with the Comintern,

457
17:58.400 --> 18:00.440
how can I explain it to them?

458
18:01.990 --> 18:04.260
It seems we cannot give up easily.

459
18:04.290 --> 18:06.200
We can't let them mess around anymore.

460
18:06.200 --> 18:07.830
I'll go talk to a few more committee members.

461
18:07.830 --> 18:10.290
I will also speak at the following meetings.

462
18:10.480 --> 18:12.390
They just deny the military line as they please.

463
18:12.390 --> 18:13.350
I don't believe

464
18:13.640 --> 18:15.020
that if they deny the Party's line,

465
18:15.020 --> 18:17.750
the committee members will still listen to them.

466
18:27.890 --> 18:28.780
Director Wang,

467
18:28.850 --> 18:30.570
I'll give you a painkiller injection

468
18:30.570 --> 18:32.050
and prescribe some aspirin

469
18:32.050 --> 18:33.250
to relieve your pain.

470
18:33.680 --> 18:34.330
Okay.

471
18:34.810 --> 18:36.640
Jiaxiang, don't move around,

472
18:37.000 --> 18:39.200
or the needle might break inside.

473
18:39.480 --> 18:41.580
Chairman, trust my skills.

474
18:42.770 --> 18:44.290
Where did the aspirin come from?

475
18:44.290 --> 18:45.290
In this Zunyi city,

476
18:45.290 --> 18:46.530
there is a Pacific Pharmacy

477
18:46.530 --> 18:47.530
with a complete range of Western medicines.

478
18:47.530 --> 18:49.090
Minister He Cheng negotiated in person

479
18:49.090 --> 18:50.570
and bought all the Western medicines,

480
18:50.570 --> 18:52.250
and the price was quite cheap.

481
18:52.640 --> 18:53.480
With this medicine,

482
18:53.480 --> 18:55.480
Comrade Jiaxiang will suffer less.

483
18:55.720 --> 18:56.320
All right.

484
18:57.030 --> 18:57.720
Come on.

485
18:58.460 --> 18:59.410
It hurts so much.

486
19:00.050 --> 19:01.090
It hurts so much.

487
19:02.480 --> 19:03.440
It's a pity

488
19:03.720 --> 19:06.960
this medicine only treats the symptoms, not the root cause.

489
19:06.960 --> 19:09.160
It's not yet time to address both the symptoms and the root cause.

490
19:09.160 --> 19:10.180
Let's treat the pain and infection first,

491
19:10.180 --> 19:11.770
as these are the most urgent problems.

492
19:11.770 --> 19:12.890
You have to survive.

493
19:12.890 --> 19:15.250
Only by surviving will you have a chance to cure the root cause.

494
19:15.250 --> 19:16.440
Comrade Zedong.

495
19:16.800 --> 19:18.330
I understand what you mean.

496
19:18.580 --> 19:21.620
But this meeting makes me anxious.

497
19:23.090 --> 19:26.200
Let's solve the military line and command issues first.

498
19:26.200 --> 19:27.930
The resolution of other issues

499
19:28.050 --> 19:29.810
requires a long time,

500
19:29.950 --> 19:31.060
a long process,

501
19:31.680 --> 19:33.410
and a more stable environment.

502
19:33.530 --> 19:35.640
After all, many comrades

503
19:35.850 --> 19:37.610
are not yet clear about the essence of it.

504
19:37.610 --> 19:39.640
Acting hastily will backfire.

505
19:39.810 --> 19:42.670
The military line and command issues are imminent,

506
19:42.720 --> 19:44.290
involving survival issues,

507
19:44.290 --> 19:46.960
which the comrades attending the meeting can also see clearly.

508
19:46.960 --> 19:48.810
Comrade Zedong said it very well.

509
19:48.810 --> 19:49.720
This meeting

510
19:50.050 --> 19:51.440
should not shake the foundation.

511
19:51.440 --> 19:52.290
Okay.

512
19:52.600 --> 19:54.640
Then let's unite

513
19:55.330 --> 19:58.590
and focus on solving the military line and command issues.

514
20:00.200 --> 20:00.800
Let's go.

515
20:03.710 --> 20:06.440
Which hurts more, getting a shot or getting shot?

516
20:06.570 --> 20:07.390
Getting a shot hurts more.

517
20:07.390 --> 20:08.230
If you can't walk, I'll carry you on my back.

518
20:08.230 --> 20:09.100
No, no, no.

519
20:13.620 --> 20:17.990
[Guiyang, Guizhou; Xue Yue's Headquarters]

520
20:18.130 --> 20:19.700
[Wang Jialie, Commander of the Kuomintang’s 25th Army,]

521
20:19.700 --> 20:21.280
[Chairman of the Guizhou Provincial Government]

522
20:36.130 --> 20:38.460
Sorry to keep you waiting, Chairman Wang.

523
20:39.090 --> 20:40.090
Boling.

524
20:40.310 --> 20:42.000
At last, you're back!

525
20:42.810 --> 20:43.770
Was the journey smooth?

526
20:43.410 --> 20:44.760
[Xue Yue, Frontline Commander of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army]

527
20:44.090 --> 20:45.370
Thank you for your concern, Chairman.

528
20:44.760 --> 20:46.110
[and Commander of the 2nd Army Group]

529
20:45.580 --> 20:46.840
The journey went well.

530
20:46.960 --> 20:47.370
Good.

531
20:47.370 --> 20:48.430
Please take a seat.

532
21:02.530 --> 21:05.460
As the Commander-in-Chief,

533
21:05.850 --> 21:07.850
how can you wear such straw sandals?

534
21:07.860 --> 21:10.230
These straw sandals are very prickly.

535
21:10.400 --> 21:11.720
If you like,

536
21:11.850 --> 21:14.780
I'll find someone to make you a few pairs of jute ones.

537
21:15.200 --> 21:17.860
If the Communist army can wear them, why can't I?

538
21:18.080 --> 21:19.450
Chairman, don't forget,

539
21:19.450 --> 21:21.390
the Communist army wore these straw sandals

540
21:21.390 --> 21:23.590
all the way from Jiangxi to Guizhou,

541
21:23.730 --> 21:25.790
plunging right into your territory,

542
21:25.800 --> 21:27.480
onto the walls of Zunyi.

543
21:28.530 --> 21:30.290
If you feel they are prickly,

544
21:31.290 --> 21:32.720
you should think of a way

545
21:32.890 --> 21:34.820
to pull this grass out by the roots.

546
21:36.510 --> 21:38.380
I do find them prickly,

547
21:39.070 --> 21:41.110
which is why I came to see you.

548
21:42.330 --> 21:45.290
I've long heard of your extreme frugality.

549
21:45.610 --> 21:47.320
Seeing it with my own eyes today,

550
21:47.320 --> 21:48.690
it is truly admirable.

551
21:48.820 --> 21:50.150
Wait, wait.

552
21:50.630 --> 21:51.570
These past few days,

553
21:51.570 --> 21:52.920
I found a Cantonese chef

554
21:53.020 --> 21:54.150
to cook a few dishes.

555
21:54.480 --> 21:56.130
They will definitely suit your taste.

556
21:56.130 --> 21:56.890
Look.

557
21:57.200 --> 21:59.160
I also brought some aged Guizhou wine.

558
21:59.160 --> 22:00.530
It's fragrant and mellow.

559
22:00.530 --> 22:02.130
Let's have a drink together.

560
22:04.570 --> 22:05.850
I am on military duty,

561
22:06.090 --> 22:07.830
so I never touch tobacco or alcohol.

562
22:07.830 --> 22:08.550
Thank you.

563
22:13.400 --> 22:16.200
You are truly a model for the Party,

564
22:16.530 --> 22:18.460
and an example for us all to follow.

565
22:22.530 --> 22:24.460
There's something you don't know.

566
22:24.530 --> 22:27.460
I have a few division and brigade commanders under me

567
22:27.850 --> 22:29.310
who are climbing the walls

568
22:29.570 --> 22:31.480
with anxiety right now.

569
22:32.040 --> 22:35.480
The Communist army is staying in Guizhou and won't leave.

570
22:35.680 --> 22:39.400
I'm afraid northern Guizhou will become like southern Jiangxi back then,

571
22:39.400 --> 22:41.240
turning into their base.

572
22:42.810 --> 22:43.570
That's great.

573
22:43.570 --> 22:46.770
It proves the Guizhou troops are eager to fight.

574
22:47.210 --> 22:47.890
Good.

575
22:48.210 --> 22:49.480
I will immediately telegraph this news

576
22:49.480 --> 22:50.790
to the Generalissimo.

577
22:51.120 --> 22:52.850
They don't want to fight at all.

578
22:54.810 --> 22:57.720
They are just worried about their little

579
22:57.720 --> 22:59.580
belongings in northern Guizhou.

580
23:01.610 --> 23:02.930
To recover Zunyi,

581
23:04.580 --> 23:06.840
we still have to rely on the Central Army.

582
23:08.720 --> 23:09.640
Chairman Wang,

583
23:10.330 --> 23:12.860
that's a bit unfair.

584
23:12.890 --> 23:14.890
Boling, please don't take offense.

585
23:15.480 --> 23:17.890
I don't see you as an outsider,

586
23:17.920 --> 23:19.570
so I'm just being honest.

587
23:20.000 --> 23:21.570
All right, I know.

588
23:21.890 --> 23:23.680
I know you didn't mean it.

589
23:24.200 --> 23:25.850
I won't beat around the bush with you.

590
23:25.850 --> 23:27.680
The Generalissimo has already started to formulate

591
23:27.680 --> 23:29.620
the encirclement and suppression plan for the south bank of the Yangtze River.

592
23:29.620 --> 23:32.950
This time, we will gather the Sichuan Army, Hunan Army, Yunnan Army,

593
23:32.950 --> 23:33.890
and the Central Army

594
23:33.890 --> 23:36.890
to encircle and suppress the Zhu-Mao Communist army.

595
23:38.000 --> 23:39.200
That's great.

596
23:39.960 --> 23:42.360
The Generalissimo is a man of great vision.

597
23:42.640 --> 23:45.840
There is hope for suppressing the Communists in Guizhou.

598
23:47.990 --> 23:50.170
When will the Generalissimo's plan

599
23:50.200 --> 23:51.570
be implemented?

600
23:51.740 --> 23:52.700
Waiting for you.

601
23:53.420 --> 23:54.770
When your Guizhou Army is ready

602
23:54.770 --> 23:55.920
for vanguard combat,

603
23:55.920 --> 23:57.610
we will implement it immediately.

604
23:57.610 --> 23:58.820
We are the vanguard?

605
23:59.440 --> 24:01.570
This is a campaign against the Communists in Guizhou.

606
24:01.570 --> 24:04.370
If the Guizhou Army isn't the vanguard, who will be?

607
24:04.370 --> 24:05.440
Could it be

608
24:06.050 --> 24:07.240
that you want others

609
24:08.240 --> 24:09.440
to do your job for you?

610
24:10.480 --> 24:11.960
But our 25th Army...

611
24:12.010 --> 24:13.720
By the way, there is one more thing.

612
24:13.720 --> 24:14.650
I almost forgot.

613
24:21.910 --> 24:24.460
Your former Deputy Commander Hou Zhidan

614
24:24.530 --> 24:26.770
fled to Chongqing after the fall of the Wu River.

615
24:26.770 --> 24:30.690
The Generalissimo has ordered him to be dismissed and investigated.

616
24:40.290 --> 24:42.910
I'll go back and mobilize the troops right away,

617
24:42.910 --> 24:43.990
get ready,

618
24:46.720 --> 24:50.000
and stand by for the Generalissimo's orders at any time.

619
24:51.920 --> 24:53.920
With you willing to be the vanguard,

620
24:54.050 --> 24:56.110
I am willing to play a supporting role

621
24:56.160 --> 24:59.620
and unite with the Guizhou Army to recover the lost territory.

622
24:59.950 --> 25:01.800
Thank you, Boling.

623
25:02.220 --> 25:03.280
I won't see you out.

624
25:11.080 --> 25:12.050
Shaowu.

625
25:15.590 --> 25:16.370
As a soldier,

626
25:17.460 --> 25:20.320
you still need to pay attention to your appearance.

627
25:26.410 --> 25:29.810
With the military situation so urgent, I have neglected my appearance.

628
25:29.810 --> 25:30.410
Farewell.

629
25:30.720 --> 25:31.440
Take care.

630
25:43.230 --> 25:44.230
Distribute them.

631
25:44.230 --> 25:44.900
Yes, sir.

632
25:53.050 --> 25:53.720
Gentlemen,

633
25:53.920 --> 25:55.290
we are in luck today.

634
25:55.330 --> 25:56.460
We're in for a treat.

635
26:09.930 --> 26:13.000
Comrades, let's continue the meeting.

636
26:24.430 --> 26:27.160
Comrades, the proposal I made at the last meeting

637
26:27.240 --> 26:28.530
to abolish the Troika,

638
26:28.680 --> 26:30.050
suspend Comrade Li De

639
26:30.200 --> 26:32.480
and Comrade Bo Gu's military command,

640
26:32.770 --> 26:35.770
and have Comrade Mao Zedong command the Red Army

641
26:36.130 --> 26:37.930
has not yet formed a resolution.

642
26:38.050 --> 26:40.000
At today's meeting, let's see

643
26:40.330 --> 26:42.810
if we can come to a conclusion.

644
26:43.090 --> 26:43.920
I agree.

645
26:44.000 --> 26:45.350
-I second that. -I second that.

646
26:45.350 --> 26:45.810
I agree.

647
26:45.810 --> 26:47.190
-I second that. -I second that.

648
26:47.190 --> 26:48.920
I disagree with this proposal.

649
26:49.310 --> 26:51.040
I disagree with this proposal.

650
26:52.440 --> 26:55.200
If there were problems with the previous military command,

651
26:55.200 --> 26:56.240
we can correct them.

652
26:56.240 --> 26:58.160
If there were problems with the previous military command,

653
26:58.160 --> 26:59.290
we can correct them.

654
26:59.400 --> 27:00.480
But what right do you have

655
27:00.480 --> 27:01.740
to abolish the Troika?

656
27:04.680 --> 27:05.480
Comrades.

657
27:06.160 --> 27:07.210
I have a proposal.

658
27:07.560 --> 27:11.570
The comrades from the Central Committee and the Military Commission have said a lot.

659
27:11.570 --> 27:14.640
Next, should we invite the cadres from each corps

660
27:14.810 --> 27:16.210
to share their thoughts?

661
27:17.180 --> 27:18.220
Comrade Bo Gu.

662
27:20.160 --> 27:21.160
I'll speak first.

663
27:21.590 --> 27:23.990
I agree with Comrade Jiaxiang's proposal.

664
27:24.010 --> 27:26.840
I agree with the speeches of Comrade Luofu and Mao.

665
27:27.480 --> 27:28.920
Let me state my position.

666
27:29.360 --> 27:31.590
Starting from the 5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

667
27:31.590 --> 27:33.200
up to the Battle of Xiang River,

668
27:33.200 --> 27:34.540
our corps have all suffered

669
27:34.540 --> 27:36.460
heavy losses due to

670
27:36.930 --> 27:38.650
flawed military command.

671
27:39.050 --> 27:40.400
So many people died.

672
27:40.920 --> 27:42.050
Who will take responsibility for that?

673
27:42.050 --> 27:44.000
How will they take responsibility?

674
27:44.000 --> 27:45.130
I don't accept this.

675
27:45.680 --> 27:46.810
I don't accept this.

676
27:48.890 --> 27:50.850
Do you think all the losses

677
27:50.850 --> 27:52.920
are solely caused by my command?

678
27:52.920 --> 27:54.380
Do you think all the losses

679
27:54.390 --> 27:56.550
are solely caused by my command?

680
27:56.690 --> 27:58.160
Are you just going to gloss over

681
27:58.160 --> 27:59.720
your failure to carry out the tactics properly?

682
27:59.720 --> 28:00.520
Comrade Li De,

683
28:00.680 --> 28:03.290
a man cannot get dead drunk

684
28:03.640 --> 28:05.300
and refuse to pay for the wine.

685
28:06.960 --> 28:08.290
If there were problems,

686
28:08.780 --> 28:10.950
why didn't you bring them up before?

687
28:11.170 --> 28:12.370
Why bring them up now?

688
28:12.400 --> 28:13.730
If there were problems,

689
28:13.740 --> 28:15.050
why didn't you bring them up before?

690
28:15.050 --> 28:16.250
Why bring them up now?

691
28:16.440 --> 28:17.480
Comrade Li De,

692
28:17.580 --> 28:21.080
[Yang Shangkun, Political Commissar of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

693
28:17.850 --> 28:19.650
haven't we brought it up enough?

694
28:19.960 --> 28:21.820
What was the use of bringing it up?

695
28:21.960 --> 28:23.890
Comrade Li De, have you forgotten?

696
28:23.920 --> 28:25.570
During the Battle of Guangchang,

697
28:25.570 --> 28:28.230
Chief of Staff Deng Ping of our 3rd Red Army Corps

698
28:28.330 --> 28:29.720
drafted a battle plan.

699
28:29.920 --> 28:31.000
But when it came to you,

700
28:31.000 --> 28:32.860
you said it was full of loopholes.

701
28:33.240 --> 28:33.970
You even said

702
28:34.050 --> 28:36.440
Chief of Staff Deng went to military academy for nothing.

703
28:36.440 --> 28:37.160
Isn't that right?

704
28:37.160 --> 28:38.250
On this issue,

705
28:39.010 --> 28:41.470
Comrade Bocheng has the most right to speak.

706
28:41.960 --> 28:43.630
Just because he raised different opinions,

707
28:43.630 --> 28:46.200
he was demoted to Chief of Staff of the 5th Corps.

708
28:46.200 --> 28:47.930
Who else would dare to speak up?

709
28:48.230 --> 28:49.760
Errors in military command

710
28:49.830 --> 28:51.640
were not unnoticed in the past.

711
28:52.630 --> 28:54.290
But who dared to bring them up?

712
28:54.720 --> 28:57.850
If you did, you would be accused of wavering in the war,

713
28:58.200 --> 28:59.460
being an opportunist,

714
28:59.480 --> 29:01.880
and ending up as a counter-revolutionary.

715
29:02.050 --> 29:04.770
Who could bear such labels?

716
29:05.000 --> 29:06.800
As for the command of the troops,

717
29:07.160 --> 29:09.050
it was also rigid and inflexible.

718
29:09.610 --> 29:10.770
You managed things in such detail.

719
29:10.770 --> 29:12.020
How could the troops

720
29:12.050 --> 29:13.770
fight with flexibility and mobility?

721
29:13.770 --> 29:16.480
Let's not talk about flexibility and mobility for now.

722
29:16.480 --> 29:18.020
Since the strategic transfer,

723
29:18.020 --> 29:21.620
our 5th Corps has been acting as the rearguard for the whole army.

724
29:21.770 --> 29:25.400
The Central Column has a lot of baggage and loads,

725
29:25.530 --> 29:26.890
moving extremely slowly.

726
29:26.890 --> 29:29.220
We couldn't go faster even if we wanted to.

727
29:29.570 --> 29:30.620
Before departure,

728
29:30.620 --> 29:32.040
the Military Commission also established

729
29:32.040 --> 29:34.610
a training division of six or seven thousand people.

730
29:34.610 --> 29:35.940
What was their mission?

731
29:36.090 --> 29:37.920
Their mission was to carry things.

732
29:37.920 --> 29:40.530
Using six or seven thousand people to carry things,

733
29:40.530 --> 29:42.560
they could only travel 5 or 10 kilometers a day at most.

734
29:42.560 --> 29:45.530
They were constantly pursued and attacked by the enemy.

735
29:45.530 --> 29:46.640
Look what the 34th Division

736
29:46.640 --> 29:47.770
of the 5th Army Corps

737
29:48.360 --> 29:49.840
has been reduced to!

738
29:50.240 --> 29:51.760
How many men survived

739
29:54.450 --> 29:56.120
out of the entire division?

740
29:56.530 --> 29:58.930
Even those who survived were disciplined.

741
29:59.480 --> 30:02.160
Zhou Zikun of the 22nd Red Army Division of the 9th Corps

742
30:02.160 --> 30:04.240
was fighting a blocking action on the east bank of the river.

743
30:04.240 --> 30:05.770
The troops were defeated.

744
30:06.200 --> 30:08.160
Out of more than 4,500 people in the whole division,

745
30:08.160 --> 30:09.490
only Zhou Zikun managed

746
30:09.640 --> 30:11.500
to break out with a dozen or so men.

747
30:11.770 --> 30:13.370
But when they reached the Xiang River,

748
30:13.370 --> 30:15.050
Comrade Li De was still unforgiving.

749
30:15.050 --> 30:16.980
He loudly reprimanded Zhou Zikun.

750
30:21.130 --> 30:22.330
Comrade Li De,

751
30:22.680 --> 30:24.410
I still remember what you said.

752
30:24.440 --> 30:26.440
You said, "Zhou Zikun,

753
30:26.960 --> 30:28.220
where are your troops?

754
30:28.370 --> 30:31.060
Without soldiers, how do you have the face to come back?"

755
30:31.060 --> 30:32.490
You said that, didn't you?

756
30:32.490 --> 30:33.530
You also had someone

757
30:33.530 --> 30:35.930
tie up the bruised and battered Zhou Zikun,

758
30:36.090 --> 30:38.530
to be sent to a military court for punishment.

759
30:38.530 --> 30:40.850
You did this, didn't you?

760
30:43.050 --> 30:45.250
Fortunately, Chairman Mao

761
30:45.570 --> 30:49.330
saved the injured Zhou Zikun in the end.

762
30:51.330 --> 30:52.630
And our 5th Red Army Division.

763
30:52.630 --> 30:55.240
The 5th Red Army Division was responsible for the blocking action at Xinxu.

764
30:55.240 --> 30:57.770
The 8th and 9th Corps suffered even heavier losses.

765
30:57.770 --> 30:58.740
At the Xiang River...

766
30:58.740 --> 31:00.070
They were all just kids.

767
31:02.130 --> 31:03.440
Some units were almost completely wiped out!

768
31:03.440 --> 31:04.040
Comrades.

769
31:04.480 --> 31:05.190
Comrades.

770
31:06.200 --> 31:07.420
We are currently holding

771
31:07.420 --> 31:09.610
an enlarged meeting of the Party's Politburo.

772
31:09.610 --> 31:11.070
We are not here to quarrel.

773
31:11.330 --> 31:12.960
It doesn't mean whoever has the loudest voice

774
31:12.960 --> 31:15.290
or strength in numbers is right,

775
31:15.720 --> 31:16.640
does it?

776
31:17.160 --> 31:18.040
Comrade Bo Gu,

777
31:19.240 --> 31:20.240
I don't think

778
31:20.850 --> 31:22.680
quarreling is a bad thing.

779
31:23.160 --> 31:24.420
It shows that our Party

780
31:24.640 --> 31:25.970
is not yet fully mature.

781
31:26.680 --> 31:27.740
To uphold the truth

782
31:28.130 --> 31:29.400
and correct mistakes,

783
31:30.770 --> 31:33.050
everyone is just expressing their opinions.

784
31:33.050 --> 31:34.400
Our pursuit of truth

785
31:34.420 --> 31:36.240
is still an ongoing exploration.

786
31:36.240 --> 31:38.770
Comrades are actively expressing their views.

787
31:38.770 --> 31:41.480
You can't just call it relying on strength in numbers.

788
31:41.480 --> 31:42.640
It only shows that

789
31:42.960 --> 31:46.020
our Party members and cadres have generally awakened.

790
31:46.610 --> 31:49.290
This will only make our Party more mature.

791
31:49.960 --> 31:51.570
Speaking of quarreling,

792
31:52.240 --> 31:55.100
around the Seventh Congress of the Fourth Red Army,

793
31:55.110 --> 31:57.880
Mao and I quarreled countless times.

794
31:58.440 --> 31:59.900
But no matter how we argue,

795
31:59.920 --> 32:01.700
our goal is the same.

796
32:03.810 --> 32:04.490
Comrades.

797
32:05.500 --> 32:06.670
In today's meeting,

798
32:07.090 --> 32:08.530
we argue for the Party,

799
32:09.370 --> 32:10.830
and we unite for the Party.

800
32:11.640 --> 32:14.370
We must also be tolerant for the sake of the Party.

801
32:14.920 --> 32:15.810
Arguing now

802
32:16.140 --> 32:18.410
is for greater unity in the future.

803
32:35.740 --> 32:36.430
Report.

804
32:36.750 --> 32:39.480
Leaders, there is an urgent military situation.

805
32:41.740 --> 32:42.870
Vice Chairman Zhou.

806
32:47.500 --> 32:49.770
Six regiments of Bai Huizhang's Guizhou Army

807
32:49.770 --> 32:51.580
have launched a fierce attack

808
32:51.610 --> 32:53.570
on the 3rd Corps stationed in Daobashui.

809
32:53.570 --> 32:55.930
We occupied someone's house for a meeting.

810
32:55.930 --> 32:57.460
They are not happy about it.

811
32:58.290 --> 32:59.180
Comrade Dehuai,

812
32:59.180 --> 33:00.240
Comrade Shangkun,

813
33:00.330 --> 33:02.290
I'm afraid you can't continue the meeting.

814
33:02.290 --> 33:02.920
Okay.

815
33:03.200 --> 33:05.150
Shangkun, back to the Corps headquarters.

816
33:05.150 --> 33:05.910
Okay.

817
33:12.000 --> 33:12.960
Comrades,

818
33:13.570 --> 33:14.770
before I leave,

819
33:15.240 --> 33:17.100
I want to make another statement.

820
33:18.560 --> 33:20.360
I completely agree with the speeches

821
33:20.360 --> 33:22.340
of Mao, Luofu, and Jiaxiang.

822
33:22.780 --> 33:24.780
Every number they listed

823
33:25.090 --> 33:27.130
and every experience they summarized

824
33:27.130 --> 33:29.400
were verified by our Red Army commanders and fighters

825
33:29.400 --> 33:31.200
with their blood.

826
33:32.610 --> 33:34.160
Comrades,

827
33:34.850 --> 33:37.510
since the 5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

828
33:38.710 --> 33:39.990
we have lost

829
33:41.610 --> 33:43.210
so many excellent comrades.

830
33:44.440 --> 33:45.910
As for our meeting today,

831
33:46.740 --> 33:48.200
no matter how it turns out,

832
33:49.260 --> 33:51.590
we should give these sacrificed comrades

833
33:54.550 --> 33:55.640
an explanation.

834
33:57.370 --> 33:58.770
It was said at the meeting

835
33:59.250 --> 34:01.850
that let whoever is responsible answer for it.

836
34:02.400 --> 34:03.920
But life is priceless.

837
34:05.130 --> 34:06.190
Once a person dies,

838
34:08.170 --> 34:10.170
they cannot be brought back to life.

839
34:10.570 --> 34:12.489
We should think carefully

840
34:13.889 --> 34:15.770
about how to pay this debt.

841
34:17.690 --> 34:19.480
We owe them a victory.

842
34:21.090 --> 34:22.550
We must use victory

843
34:25.960 --> 34:27.020
to pay them back.

844
34:51.540 --> 34:52.670
Comrade Dehuai,

845
34:55.270 --> 34:56.330
Comrade Shangkun,

846
34:56.989 --> 34:58.650
the enemy is coming fiercely this time.

847
34:58.650 --> 35:00.270
Your 3rd Corps is under great pressure.

848
35:00.270 --> 35:02.200
Vice Chairman Zhou, rest assured.

849
35:02.210 --> 35:03.400
You can count on us at the front.

850
35:03.400 --> 35:04.910
You can have the meeting in peace.

851
35:04.910 --> 35:08.090
Also, we can't fight like before.

852
35:08.290 --> 35:10.480
We should fight like we did after the Liping meeting,

853
35:10.480 --> 35:11.890
crossing the Wu River and occupying Zunyi,

854
35:11.890 --> 35:13.850
being flexible and taking them by surprise.

855
35:13.850 --> 35:16.580
This is the tactic our Red Army is good at.

856
35:17.600 --> 35:19.690
Comrade Enlai, to fight like this,

857
35:19.770 --> 35:21.000
Mao has a way.

858
35:21.480 --> 35:22.410
Comrade Dehuai,

859
35:22.520 --> 35:23.580
Comrade Shangkun,

860
35:23.960 --> 35:25.490
I understand what you mean.

861
35:25.810 --> 35:27.170
Please rest assured.

862
35:32.920 --> 35:33.500
Let's go.

863
35:50.930 --> 35:51.820
Comrades,

864
35:52.220 --> 35:54.090
I would like to make a supplementary speech.

865
35:54.090 --> 35:56.760
I completely agree with the opinions of Comrade Luofu,

866
35:56.760 --> 35:58.730
Comrade Zedong, Comrade Jiaxiang,

867
35:58.730 --> 36:00.210
and the other comrades.

868
36:00.850 --> 36:03.310
As one of the people responsible for the wrong military line,

869
36:03.310 --> 36:05.080
I request the Central Committee

870
36:05.080 --> 36:06.410
to remove me from my post

871
36:07.000 --> 36:08.690
and return my military command

872
36:08.690 --> 36:09.610
to the Party.

873
36:10.030 --> 36:12.200
I would also like to formally propose

874
36:12.730 --> 36:15.250
that Comrade Mao Zedong be reinstated to a leadership position

875
36:15.250 --> 36:16.560
in the Red Army,

876
36:16.730 --> 36:19.330
responsible for directing field operations.

877
36:19.520 --> 36:21.380
Does anyone have any objections?

878
36:22.720 --> 36:23.990
Comrade Mao Zedong

879
36:25.170 --> 36:27.030
has worked with me for a long time.

880
36:27.170 --> 36:29.360
Even the enemy calls us Zhu-Mao.

881
36:29.750 --> 36:31.590
I know his abilities well.

882
36:31.900 --> 36:33.500
He created and applied

883
36:33.650 --> 36:35.330
flexible and mobile strategies and tactics,

884
36:35.330 --> 36:36.330
and achieved

885
36:36.360 --> 36:38.520
victory in the first 4 Counter-Encirclement Campaigns.

886
36:38.520 --> 36:39.600
Facts have proved

887
36:39.770 --> 36:42.370
that he has the ability to command the Red Army.

888
36:43.040 --> 36:44.850
I agree with Enlai's opinion.

889
36:45.210 --> 36:45.690
Agreed.

890
36:45.690 --> 36:47.120
-I second that. -I second that.

891
36:47.120 --> 36:47.890
Agreed.

892
36:47.910 --> 36:49.640
-I second that. -I second that.

893
36:52.400 --> 36:53.330
I disagree.

894
36:54.520 --> 36:57.210
You all say Comrade Mao Zedong can command battles,

895
36:57.210 --> 36:58.690
but he relies on nothing more than

896
36:58.690 --> 37:00.770
Romance of the Three Kingdoms and Sun Tzu's The Art of War.

897
37:00.770 --> 37:02.570
What's so brilliant about that?

898
37:02.650 --> 37:03.650
Comrade Kai Feng,

899
37:04.730 --> 37:06.040
I would like to ask you,

900
37:06.440 --> 37:08.970
how many chapters are there in Sun Tzu's The Art of War?

901
37:08.970 --> 37:11.100
What is the title of the first chapter?

902
37:12.080 --> 37:13.940
It seems you haven't even read it.

903
37:14.110 --> 37:16.200
Then how can you conclude that I

904
37:16.410 --> 37:18.670
rely on The Art of War to command battles?

905
37:18.730 --> 37:19.600
In other words,

906
37:19.850 --> 37:22.160
even if I rely on these two books to command battles,

907
37:22.160 --> 37:24.690
that is borrowing the wisdom of our ancestors

908
37:24.960 --> 37:26.120
to face the enemy.

909
37:26.330 --> 37:27.660
What's wrong with that?

910
37:27.920 --> 37:28.890
Think again,

911
37:29.140 --> 37:31.000
and find another reason to disagree.

912
37:31.000 --> 37:32.200
Think about it again.

913
37:32.210 --> 37:32.810
All right.

914
37:33.170 --> 37:34.690
I'll make my position clear.

915
37:34.690 --> 37:35.680
I don't agree to replace

916
37:35.680 --> 37:37.010
Comrades Bo Gu and Li De.

917
37:37.170 --> 37:38.170
Comrade Kai Feng,

918
37:38.330 --> 37:39.730
why don't you understand?

919
37:39.730 --> 37:40.860
Practice has proved

920
37:40.890 --> 37:42.370
that the current wrong command

921
37:42.370 --> 37:43.700
can no longer continue.

922
37:43.890 --> 37:45.750
Fight according to what you have.

923
37:45.890 --> 37:47.000
Without capital,

924
37:47.770 --> 37:49.420
how can we fight a Western-style war?

925
37:49.420 --> 37:50.670
Such blind command

926
37:50.920 --> 37:52.290
can no longer continue.

927
37:52.890 --> 37:53.520
In short,

928
37:53.850 --> 37:56.600
the Chinese Red Army must rely on its own ability.

929
37:56.920 --> 37:58.400
Well said, Commander-in-Chief.

930
37:58.400 --> 38:01.130
The Chinese Red Army must rely on its own ability.

931
38:01.330 --> 38:02.370
Now our Party

932
38:02.480 --> 38:03.920
must also rely on its own ability

933
38:03.920 --> 38:05.120
to correct the past

934
38:05.120 --> 38:06.170
military leadership mistakes.

935
38:06.170 --> 38:08.120
Correcting the so-called military mistakes

936
38:08.120 --> 38:10.570
doesn't mean we have to replace the leaders.

937
38:10.570 --> 38:11.530
Comrade Bo Gu

938
38:11.730 --> 38:13.770
is the Party leader designated by Comrade Wang Ming

939
38:13.770 --> 38:15.320
and the Comintern.

940
38:15.850 --> 38:16.690
Comrade Li De

941
38:16.750 --> 38:18.920
graduated from the Frunze Military Academy.

942
38:18.920 --> 38:21.400
He is a military advisor sent by the Comintern.

943
38:21.400 --> 38:23.790
How can they be replaced just like that?

944
38:24.420 --> 38:26.350
But facts speak louder than words.

945
38:26.850 --> 38:28.400
Since the 5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

946
38:28.400 --> 38:30.400
the Red Army has been losing ground.

947
38:30.890 --> 38:32.350
We suffered heavy losses.

948
38:32.890 --> 38:34.080
That is a fact.

949
38:34.870 --> 38:38.060
Yesterday, Li De said we were afraid of sacrifice.

950
38:38.290 --> 38:39.290
I want to say this.

951
38:39.370 --> 38:42.160
Even with the wrong military line in the past,

952
38:42.400 --> 38:45.000
our comrades still resolutely carried it out.

953
38:45.120 --> 38:47.520
Knowing they would face heavy sacrifices,

954
38:47.730 --> 38:49.730
they still advanced wave upon wave.

955
38:49.890 --> 38:52.330
Are they really afraid of sacrifice?

956
38:52.690 --> 38:54.290
But our hearts ache.

957
38:54.650 --> 38:57.250
Who among us here doesn't cherish the Red Army?

958
38:57.370 --> 39:00.200
Who is willing to watch them

959
39:00.400 --> 39:01.810
die in vain?

960
39:02.890 --> 39:05.700
I meant to keep this about the issue, not the person,

961
39:05.700 --> 39:08.350
but now some people still insist on

962
39:08.400 --> 39:09.850
the previous wrong leadership.

963
39:09.850 --> 39:10.490
Fine.

964
39:11.030 --> 39:14.420
I, Zhu De, will restate my position.

965
39:15.040 --> 39:19.330
If you insist on this erroneous leadership,

966
39:20.810 --> 39:21.700
we

967
39:25.330 --> 39:27.130
will not follow you anymore.

968
39:29.130 --> 39:30.710
If you still follow the previous way,

969
39:30.710 --> 39:32.940
we will not follow you anymore.

970
39:53.600 --> 39:54.710
I request to speak.

971
39:55.580 --> 39:56.510
Comrade Shaoqi,

972
39:56.690 --> 39:57.730
you may speak.

973
39:58.440 --> 40:00.040
Regarding military issues,

974
40:01.120 --> 40:04.080
everyone has discussed them in detail.

975
40:05.320 --> 40:06.920
I fully support the views of Comrade Mao Zedong

976
40:06.920 --> 40:08.780
and the majority of the comrades.

977
40:09.330 --> 40:12.560
I have always been in charge of the work in the areas under Nationalist control.

978
40:12.560 --> 40:13.890
What I want to say is that

979
40:13.960 --> 40:16.040
since the Fourth Plenary Session of the Sixth Central Committee,

980
40:16.040 --> 40:18.210
in its work in the areas under Nationalist control, the Central Committee

981
40:18.210 --> 40:19.770
has made a series of serious

982
40:19.920 --> 40:21.520
errors of Left adventurism.

983
40:22.220 --> 40:23.130
This directly led to

984
40:23.130 --> 40:25.080
the workers' movement and Party organizations in the areas under Nationalist control

985
40:25.080 --> 40:25.880
suffering...

986
40:26.480 --> 40:28.610
suffering extremely serious losses.

987
40:29.290 --> 40:30.290
So I would like to

988
40:30.640 --> 40:33.690
propose a discussion on whether the political line pursued by the Party

989
40:33.690 --> 40:37.020
in the areas under Nationalist control and the Soviet areas

990
40:37.080 --> 40:38.540
is correct.

991
40:39.120 --> 40:40.650
Let's discuss

992
40:40.650 --> 40:46.600
political issues in the areas under Nationalist control and the Soviet Areas.

993
40:47.810 --> 40:49.690
I disagree with Comrade Liu Shaoqi's

994
40:49.690 --> 40:51.480
questioning of the Central Committee's line.

995
40:51.480 --> 40:52.640
Is it just because we

996
40:52.890 --> 40:53.890
failed to smash the enemy's

997
40:53.890 --> 40:54.960
5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign

998
40:54.960 --> 40:57.290
that we can deny the Party's line and policies?

999
40:57.290 --> 40:58.750
I roughly calculated that

1000
40:58.920 --> 41:01.290
among all 20 people attending this meeting,

1001
41:01.290 --> 41:02.400
except for Mao Zedong

1002
41:02.400 --> 41:03.920
and a few other comrades,

1003
41:04.250 --> 41:05.850
the vast majority of comrades

1004
41:05.850 --> 41:07.520
have studied abroad.

1005
41:07.770 --> 41:10.690
Basically, they have all worked

1006
41:11.120 --> 41:12.380
and studied in Moscow.

1007
41:12.440 --> 41:13.700
I would like to ask you,

1008
41:13.850 --> 41:15.170
don't you know

1009
41:15.370 --> 41:17.570
how the Party's policy line came about?

1010
41:18.080 --> 41:18.890
Comrade Bo Gu.

1011
41:18.910 --> 41:19.840
Comrade Shaoqi,

1012
41:19.900 --> 41:23.590
the issues you raised are too complex.

1013
41:24.170 --> 41:25.730
Even if you went on about them for 3 days and 3 nights,

1014
41:25.730 --> 41:26.810
would you ever get through them all?

1015
41:26.810 --> 41:29.370
It's like taking a pancake baked over a slow fire

1016
41:29.370 --> 41:31.960
and throwing it into a roaring stove.

1017
41:32.210 --> 41:34.170
Who could eat that pancake then?

1018
41:37.520 --> 41:38.650
Comrade Bo Gu,

1019
41:38.920 --> 41:40.040
you are right.

1020
41:40.480 --> 41:42.410
Among the comrades present today,

1021
41:42.560 --> 41:45.390
indeed, only a few of us

1022
41:45.740 --> 41:47.270
have never studied abroad.

1023
41:47.690 --> 41:49.020
But what does this show?

1024
41:49.060 --> 41:51.250
This shows that most of the comrades attending today's meeting

1025
41:51.250 --> 41:55.400
developed their revolutionary convictions and do things

1026
41:55.920 --> 41:58.080
on the teachings

1027
41:58.210 --> 41:59.670
of the Soviet Revolution.

1028
41:59.690 --> 42:02.220
It shows that everyone's loyalty to the Party

1029
42:02.250 --> 42:03.770
and faith in Marxism

1030
42:04.120 --> 42:05.480
are unquestionable.

1031
42:06.000 --> 42:07.920
Even if a few of us haven't been to the Soviet Union,

1032
42:07.920 --> 42:09.290
everyone will admit

1033
42:09.520 --> 42:10.890
that our Marxist faith

1034
42:10.920 --> 42:12.090
is unquestionable.

1035
42:12.480 --> 42:13.880
Today, we are correcting

1036
42:14.120 --> 42:16.120
the mistakes in military leadership,

1037
42:16.120 --> 42:18.560
not to create divisions in the Party.

1038
42:18.810 --> 42:19.740
On the contrary,

1039
42:19.890 --> 42:21.420
it is to make us more united,

1040
42:21.690 --> 42:24.650
to enhance the prestige of our Party and the Military Commission,

1041
42:24.650 --> 42:25.920
and to put our military leadership

1042
42:25.920 --> 42:27.770
on the right path.

1043
42:29.400 --> 42:30.200
After the 5th Encirclement Campaign

1044
42:30.200 --> 42:30.970
began,

1045
42:31.650 --> 42:32.470
I stressed

1046
42:34.000 --> 42:36.450
the need to keep the enemy beyond our Repbublic.

1047
42:36.450 --> 42:37.960
It was because the word "Republic" in the

1048
42:37.960 --> 42:40.600
Chinese Soviet Republic, of which you are the chairman,

1049
42:40.600 --> 42:42.210
weighed heavily on my mind.

1050
42:42.960 --> 42:45.290
Yesterday, some people said

1051
42:47.080 --> 42:48.400
I was a traitor.

1052
42:49.080 --> 42:50.000
At that time,

1053
42:50.440 --> 42:52.560
I was afraid of bearing this charge.

1054
42:53.080 --> 42:55.170
How could I explain it to the Comintern?

1055
42:55.170 --> 42:57.480
How could I explain it to Comrade Wang Ming?

1056
42:57.480 --> 42:58.810
This involves

1057
42:58.810 --> 43:00.170
the major principle of the political line,

1058
43:00.170 --> 43:01.040
Comrades.

1059
43:02.410 --> 43:04.100
Who could possibly bear that responsibility?
